'' RUN: 'new T( u )' with a ustring u for a 'byval as wstring ptr' constructor parameter, over
'' an overloaded and a single constructor, a non-empty and an empty ustring, and an rvalue. It
'' stopped on TKO0994 (lvalue) or passed the wrong bytes (rvalue, len 3).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/mir/src/new-ctor-ustring-wptr.bas -o tests/mir/newctorustrwptr.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
